## The Science of 120-Word Video Scripts

In short-form video advertising, word economy is everything. A standard 30-second TikTok or Reels video allows for approximately **65 to 75 spoken words**. Every single syllable must perform heavy emotional lifting.

Amateur advertisers write descriptive scripts that explain what the product is. **Elite copywriters write emotional scripts that agitate who the customer wants to become.**

Below are 5 battle-tested direct-response scriptwriting frameworks adapted specifically for high-velocity vertical video.

![30-Second Direct Response Video Pacing Timeline](/api/media/blog/scriptwriting-frameworks-direct-response-video/script-pacing-timeline.png)

---

## 1. The PAS Framework (Problem - Agitate - Solve)

The most reliable direct-response framework for problem-solving gadgets, cleaning supplies, and ergonomics.
- **Problem (0:00 - 0:03)**: *"Does your lower back scream every time you sit at your desk past 2 PM?"*
- **Agitate (0:04 - 0:12)**: *"Most office chairs force your spine into a terrible posture, causing chronic neck stiffness and energy crashes that ruin your evenings."*
- **Solve (0:13 - 0:24)**: *"I switched to this ergonomic honeycomb cushion last week. The medical-grade gel distributes pressure away from your tailbone instantly."*
- **CTA (0:25 - 0:30)**: *"Try it for 30 days risk-free. Your back will thank you—link below."*

---

## 2. The Before - After - Bridge (BAB)

Best for beauty, fitness, organization, and home improvement niches where visual transformation is dramatic.
- **Before (0:00 - 0:04)**: *"My kitchen pantry used to look like a tornado hit it every single morning."*
- **After (0:05 - 0:12)**: *"Now, everything is categorized, airtight, and looks like a Pinterest dream board."*
- **Bridge (0:13 - 0:24)**: *"The secret is these modular vacuum-lock containers. One press seals out moisture, and they stack cleanly in any cabinet size."*
- **CTA (0:25 - 0:30)**: *"Grab the 10-piece starter bundle while the flash sale is active."*

---

## 3. The Hook - Story - Offer (HSO)

The Russell Brunson direct-response staple, condensed into a 30-second viral creator narrative.
- **Hook (0:00 - 0:03)**: *"I cancelled my $120 monthly salon membership and did this instead."*
- **Story (0:04 - 0:18)**: *"I was tired of spending half my Saturday under harsh salon lights just to touch up my roots. A friend who works in cosmetology showed me this at-home peptide glaze. It takes 5 minutes in the shower and leaves high-gloss shine for 6 weeks."*
- **Offer (0:19 - 0:30)**: *"Right now they're doing buy-one-get-one 50% off with free shipping. Tap the button below to get your shade."*

---

## 4. The Us vs. Them Comparison Formula

Best for competitive commodity markets (supplements, mattresses, apparel, phone cases).
- **Hook (0:00 - 0:03)**: *"Why I threw away all my expensive department store [Category]..."*
- **Them (0:04 - 0:12)**: *"Standard brands charge $90 because of massive retail markups, but use cheap polyester that pills after two washes."*
- **Us (0:13 - 0:22)**: *"[Our Brand] sells directly from the textile mill with 100% long-staple organic cotton. It gets softer with every wash."*
- **CTA (0:23 - 0:30)**: *"Experience the difference. 100-night trial with free returns."*

---

## 5. The Skeptical Reviewer Framework

Overcomes extreme buyer resistance for products that sound "too good to be true."
- **Hook (0:00 - 0:03)**: *"I 100% thought this was going to be total garbage."*
- **Validation (0:04 - 0:14)**: *"I've tried 4 different handheld steamers and every single one sputtered boiling water all over my clothes. But look at this steam output..."*
- **Proof (0:15 - 0:24)**: *"Completely wrinkle-free linen shirt in literally 45 seconds. No leaks, no burns."*
- **CTA (0:25 - 0:30)**: *"Best $35 I've spent all year. Order yours through the TikTok Shop link below."*

